{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_52_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_52","textTraditional":"一、二十有三年，春，公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_52_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_52","textTraditional":"桓公之盟不日，其會不致，信之也。此之桓國何以致？危之也。何危爾？公一陳佗也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_52_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_52","textTraditional":"二、祭叔來聘。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_52_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_52","textTraditional":"三、夏，公如齊觀社。公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_52_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_52","textTraditional":"何以書？譏。何譏爾？諸侯越竟觀社，非禮也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_52_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_52","textTraditional":"四、荊人來聘。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_52_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_52","textTraditional":"荊人何以稱人？始能聘也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_52_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_52","textTraditional":"五、公及齊侯遇於穀。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_52_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_52","textTraditional":"六、蕭叔朝公。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_52_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_52","textTraditional":"其言朝公何？公在外也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_52_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_52","textTraditional":"七、秋，丹桓宮楹。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_52_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_52","textTraditional":"何以書？譏。何譏爾？丹桓宮楹，非禮也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_52_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_52","textTraditional":"八、冬，十有一月，曹伯射姑卒。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_52_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_52","textTraditional":"九、十有二月甲寅，公會齊侯盟于扈。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_52_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_52","textTraditional":"桓之盟不日，此何以日？危之也。何危爾？我貳也。魯子曰：「我貳者，非彼然，我然也。」","sentenceOrder":15}],"overrides":{}}